## Session Startup

1. Read this file.
2. Read `<long-term-memory-entry>`.
3. Resolve the active scope and read its `<status-entry>`.
4. Follow task-specific routes; do not load every topic memory.
5. Verify consequential state against physical artifacts before mutation.

## Session Closure

1. Verify claimed outputs.
2. Update current status and the next executable action.
3. Update design, asset indexes, and history only where their truth changed.
4. Archive closed detail and retain a route to it.

